rough interviews with current residents, Polsterâ€™s film weaves a sobering tapestry of experiences â€“ in spite of the centreâ€™s resistance to the documentary project. Many asylum seekers speak of poor living conditions, lack of access to legal support, and the impossibility of social integration due to the campâ€™s remote location. Their legal limbo, caused by excessive delays in application processing, leads to further psychological distress. In one heartbreaking scene, a detainee looks wistfully at the cattle herds that graze nearby, envious of their freedom of movement. With strict curfew hours and few recreational activities on offer, time at the BÃ¼rglkopf camp stretches on seemingly infinitely.</p> <a href="https://www.theguardian.com/film/2026/jul/20/out-of-sight-review-asylum-seekers-alps">Continue reading...</a>ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;T4Ik8q5wkVLQH8fwPO8Eu42fRt65_fJu5gkxfmj5x40ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxiOut of Sight review â€“ mountain idyll on the Swiss border is a gilded cage for distressed asylum seekersƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Fnojs98C3fBonD0Y3r17ym7eaWBajWWUu-MhGbEz5qAƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkoSyndicationItemƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Dxm8zRoZ0potTqB0kMHgXsKe4jMekiR-S904v6JKmv0ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxThttps://www.theguardian.com/film/2026/jul/20/out-of-sight-review-asylum-seekers-alpsƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;zEmVdFvpqtrdsMiaPbxWuKcDSmlro9Y9pAk0kZjrRMoƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx`out-of-sight-review-mountain-idyll-on-the-swiss-border-is-a-gilded-cage-for-distressed-asylum-seƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;r1IVNLKgvHv_v0M0__aXiS4K6f-HS